      "@id": "kt:technical-debt-in-salesforce",
      "@type": "kto:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Technical Debt in Salesforce",
      "skos:definition": "The accumulated cost of expedient configuration and code choices in a Salesforce org (unused metadata, outdated automation, hard-coded references, untestable code) that makes later change slower, riskier or impossible.",
