      "@id": "kt:headless-identity",
      "@type": "kto:Feature",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Headless Identity",
      "skos:definition": "A set of Salesforce Customer Identity APIs (headless login, registration, passwordless login, forgot password, guest user and native SSO) that let an off-platform web or mobile app own its entire login UI while an Experience Cloud site handles authentication, user records and access in the background.",
