      "skos:prefLabel": "NIST Cybersecurity Framework",
      "skos:definition": "NIST's voluntary, outcome-based framework for managing cybersecurity risk, organized in version 2.0 (CSWP 29, February 2024) into six Functions (Govern, Identify, Protect, Detect, Respond, Recover) plus Profiles and Tiers; it says what to achieve and points to control catalogs such as SP 800-53 for how.",
